#! program build/docs-examples/bin/cb_shortcuts
#! frames  375
#! poster  330
#! keys
# Blocks focused: down selects the next block, ctrl+s saves the blocks; down in the name field: the list stays;
# Log focused: ctrl+s saves the log, down leaves the list, f5 presses Run; f1 in the command field: its help; after
# escape, f1: the general help
0   move 600 250
10  move 180 20 15
28  down
30  up
45  key down
70  key ctrl down
71  key s
72  key ctrl up
95  move 120 126 15
113 down
115 up
135 key down
160 key escape
175 move 540 20 15
193 down
195 up
215 key ctrl down
216 key s
217 key ctrl up
240 key down
260 key f5
280 move 480 88 15
298 down
300 up
315 key f1
340 key escape
355 key f1
